			"hadithnumber": 1207,
			"arabicnumber": 1207,
			"text": "Anas narrated that the Prophet (ﷺ) said about the major sins:\"Associating partners with Allah, disobeying parents, killing oneself, and false speech.\" He said: There are narrations on this topic from Abu Bakrah, Ayman bin Khuraim, and Ibn 'Umar Abu 'Eisa said: The Hadith of Anas is a Hasan Sahih Gharib Hadith",
